us area is located 0 4cm from the deep margin  Sectioning through the remaining specimen reveals unremarkable fibrofatty tissue with no other lesions or masses grossly appreciated or palpated  Representative sections are submitted  SECTION CODE A B  First fibrous area to the deep margin  C D  First fibrous area to the anterior margin  E F  Second fibrous area to the deep margin  G H  Second fibrous area to skin  I  Random sections of remaining breast  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary sentinel node  are two lymph nodes measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  Each has a small amount of attached adipose tissue  The smaller lymph node is submitted in toto along with a representative section of the larger lymph node in cassette J  Gross Description by  PAMELA ROMAN                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODE  LEFT AXILLARY SENTINAL  , Positive.
